Reviewed-by: Bradley Morgan <brads@mainlining.org>
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Hui Peng <benquike@gmail.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260922023204.2504832-1-benquike@gmail.com
